      "claim_id": "majority-ground",
      "proposition": "The majority will hold that the unmodified phrase 'goods or services from a video tape service provider' covers any goods or services supplied by an entity that meets the statutory provider definition; the express audiovisual limitation elsewhere in the VPPA confirms that courts may not insert one into the consumer definition."
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "ground-breadth",
      "proposition": "The Court will adopt a categorical but element-specific rule that consumer status does not require an audiovisual transaction, while leaving for remand whether Paramount is a covered provider, whether Salazar was a subscriber, and whether the disclosed data was protected personally identifiable information."
    }
  ],
